<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/images/demos/demo-20/ChapterChase.png">
    <title>ChapterChase</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        .guarantee-box {
            background-color: #ecf0f1;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .steps {
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .steps h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .steps ol {
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        .contact {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            body {
                padding: 10px;
            }
            .guarantee-box, .steps {
                padding: 15px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>ChapterChase Money-Back Guarantee</h1>
    </header>
    
    <div class="guarantee-box">
        <h2>Our Promise to You</h2>
        <p>At ChapterChase, we're committed to your satisfaction. If you're not completely happy with your purchase, we offer a 30-day money-back guarantee on all our products.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="steps">
        <h2>How It Works</h2>
        <ol>
            <li>Purchase any book from our store.</li>
            <li>If you're not satisfied, contact us within 30 days of your purchase.</li>
            <li>Return the book in its original condition.</li>
            <li>We'll process your refund within 5-7 business days.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>
    
    <div class="guarantee-box">
        <h2>Terms and Conditions</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>The 30-day period begins on the day of delivery.</li>
            <li>Books must be returned in their original condition.</li>
            <li>Shipping costs for returns are the responsibility of the customer.</li>
            <li>Special edition or personalized books may not be eligible for return.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div class="contact">
        <h2>Questions?</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about our money-back guarantee, please don't hesitate to contact our customer service team.</p>
        <p>Email: support@chapterchase.com</p>
        <p>6282031090</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>